<Defs>

  <!--
    Every value is a multiplier on one kind of reaction, so 1 means "this trait doesn't care".
    Fields, in the order the mod uses them:

      missing   - someone they're fond of is away
      relief    - that person comes back
      gloating  - someone they can't stand is away
      dread     - that person comes back
      homesick  - being away from home themselves
      company   - travelling next to people they like
      friction  - travelling next to people they don't

    Traits are matched by name at load, so anything from a mod that isn't installed is
    ignored quietly. Adding support for another trait mod means another file like this one,
    nothing else.
  -->

